Description: OpenSesame plugin for the Radboud Buttonbox
 This plugin for the OpenSesame experiment builder collects
 button responses, sound and voice detection, and sends
 stimulus synchronization triggers with the Radboud Buttonbox
 (BITSI), through the RuSocSci package.
